  * Observe GPA 4.1

    var : gpa
    Probabilities (truncated):
    4.109083606912328: 0.0400000000000000
    4.108320150574818: 0.0400000000000000
    4.108249672738951: 0.0400000000000000
    4.106630577755454: 0.0400000000000000
    .........
    4.092139552390267: 0.0400000000000000
    4.090959901963807: 0.0400000000000000
    4.090655261692896: 0.0400000000000000
    4.090297838715044: 0.0400000000000000
