    mean = [false = 1.0]

  * Observe nationality = usa

    var : gpa
    Probabilities (truncated):
    4.0: 0.1568432890123702
    3.999496482312445: 0.0000661506912747
    3.999053506180203: 0.0000661506912747
    3.99875643849315: 0.0000661506912747
    .........
    0.001365123317281: 0.0000661506912747
    0.001136243343882: 0.0000661506912747
